    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/263c2d8f4a5cf7af79e838bdb0c2d4f9.avif?t=1750467613\" /></div><strong>A dark and forgotten secret lies hidden within the enchanting realm of Tynedale, waiting to be unveiled. Join Geordie on an epic quest to achieve what his grandfather could not: to navigate treacherous dungeons, vanquish formidable bosses, and unearth the sinister truth lurking in the shadows.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/0677edc2241855ee074b40fff0437a25.poster.avif?t=1750467613\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/0677edc2241855ee074b40fff0437a25.webm?t=1750467613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/0677edc2241855ee074b40fff0437a25.mp4?t=1750467613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/f5aae7c8b92a9fc484ada8ad45d19346.avif?t=1750467613\" /></div><strong>The Legends of Tynedale</strong> beckons you to immerse yourself in a stunning pixel art world, brimming with adventure and mystery.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock a Vast World:</strong> Journey through the vibrant and diverse landscapes of Tynedale, each area filled with challenges and secrets begging to be discovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Master Intricate Dungeons:</strong> Dive into increasingly complex puzzle-box and lock &amp; key dungeons, where wit and strategy are your greatest allies against cunning traps and obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Epic Battles Await:</strong> Engage in thrilling combat against a myriad of monsters and colossal bosses, each encounter more exhilarating than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unravel Hidden Mysteries:</strong> Delve deep into the lore of Tynedale as you uncover secrets and collect treasures that reveal the land\u2019s dark history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Forge Powerful Weapons and Tools:</strong> Unlock and master an array of formidable weapons and ingenious tools that will enhance your abilities and open new pathways through the enigmatic world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a quest like no other in <strong>The Legends of Tynedale</strong>, where every discovery brings you closer to unravelling the ultimate mystery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/23ec07963ec5a64c95df563dc52736d5.poster.avif?t=1750467613\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/23ec07963ec5a64c95df563dc52736d5.webm?t=1750467613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/23ec07963ec5a64c95df563dc52736d5.mp4?t=1750467613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/57bce14fa0f8e6625e9496bcc88d8229.poster.avif?t=1750467613\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/57bce14fa0f8e6625e9496bcc88d8229.webm?t=1750467613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/57bce14fa0f8e6625e9496bcc88d8229.mp4?t=1750467613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/263c2d8f4a5cf7af79e838bdb0c2d4f9.avif?t=1750467613\" /></div><strong>A dark and forgotten secret lies hidden within the enchanting realm of Tynedale, waiting to be unveiled. Join Geordie on an epic quest to achieve what his grandfather could not: to navigate treacherous dungeons, vanquish formidable bosses, and unearth the sinister truth lurking in the shadows.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/0677edc2241855ee074b40fff0437a25.poster.avif?t=1750467613\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/0677edc2241855ee074b40fff0437a25.webm?t=1750467613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/0677edc2241855ee074b40fff0437a25.mp4?t=1750467613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/f5aae7c8b92a9fc484ada8ad45d19346.avif?t=1750467613\" /></div><strong>The Legends of Tynedale</strong> beckons you to immerse yourself in a stunning pixel art world, brimming with adventure and mystery.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock a Vast World:</strong> Journey through the vibrant and diverse landscapes of Tynedale, each area filled with challenges and secrets begging to be discovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Master Intricate Dungeons:</strong> Dive into increasingly complex puzzle-box and lock &amp; key dungeons, where wit and strategy are your greatest allies against cunning traps and obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Epic Battles Await:</strong> Engage in thrilling combat against a myriad of monsters and colossal bosses, each encounter more exhilarating than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unravel Hidden Mysteries:</strong> Delve deep into the lore of Tynedale as you uncover secrets and collect treasures that reveal the land\u2019s dark history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Forge Powerful Weapons and Tools:</strong> Unlock and master an array of formidable weapons and ingenious tools that will enhance your abilities and open new pathways through the enigmatic world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a quest like no other in <strong>The Legends of Tynedale</strong>, where every discovery brings you closer to unravelling the ultimate mystery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/23ec07963ec5a64c95df563dc52736d5.poster.avif?t=1750467613\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/23ec07963ec5a64c95df563dc52736d5.webm?t=1750467613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/23ec07963ec5a64c95df563dc52736d5.mp4?t=1750467613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/57bce14fa0f8e6625e9496bcc88d8229.poster.avif?t=1750467613\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/57bce14fa0f8e6625e9496bcc88d8229.webm?t=1750467613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=